{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/aras-residence-aras-development-majan","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":381,"crm_id":"1975","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Aras Residence","slug":"aras-residence-aras-development-majan","display_address":"Majan","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Aras Group","price":620000,"display_price":"620K","lattitude":25.0935608,"longitude":55.3119584,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"Aras Residence is a ready-made project by the developer Aras Development, located in the prestigious Majan district, adjacent to the famous Dubailand. The sleek and modern facade design harmonizes well with the surrounding area. The rhythmic terracotta elements of the exterior are eye-catching.<p>The 11-story complex features cozy apartments to suit any taste, ranging from studios to three-bedroom units. All residences are meticulously designed and equipped with modern kitchens. Large double-glazed windows prevent noise and dust from entering, and balconies offer beautiful views of the green recreational areas surrounding Aras Residence. Residents' security is ensured through a round-the-clock video surveillance system. Additionally, the entire complex is equipped with emergency fire extinguishing sensors.<p>After a busy day, residents of Aras Residence can enjoy the coolness of the pool located on the premises, play with children at the specially equipped playground, or spend time in pleasant company in the leisure lounge area.<p>Nearby Aras Residence, there are numerous parks and retail outlets, restaurants, and cafes. The excellent transport accessibility of the Majan district, close to Emirates Road and Mohammed Bin Zayed Road, provides maximum convenience for visiting major leisure and business centers.<p>The fa